    "description": "<p>A Speed 6 long ticks interrogation. The Solar's player rolls (appropriate Social Attribute + Investigation). This Charm exerts unnatural mental influence; the target can resist with MDV. If the roll succeeds, the target is compelled to answer questions honestly. Resisting costs one Willpower per five minutes, to a maximum of three Willpower, and the compulsion lasts for one scene. Loses effectiveness with repeated use: increase the target's MDV by three if an Exalt has used this Charm or a similar one on the target this story.</p>",
